==Changelog, December 6th==
{{Collapsed section|18|CLICK TO EXPAND - (Changelog, November 30th)}}
'''Quest Speedrunning - Batch #3'''
* A Taste of Hope and Sins of the Father are now available to speedrun!
* Made changes to the trophy times for Beneath Cursed Sands.
* Below Ice Mountain and Temple of the Eye have entered into Open Beta.
* Items dropped due to Inventory overflow are now correctly deleted when starting a fresh speedrun.

'''Poll 77 Changes'''
* Essence Pouches have been added to the Guardians of the Rift loot table.
* Cordelia can now repair Pouches.
* You can now change the default destination on the deep Wilderness lever.
* The random cycle delay has been removed from a variety of Mining sources.

'''Tombs of Amascut: Combat Achievements'''
* 'Amascut's Remnant' will now be retroactively completed when opening the Combat Achievements interface for those players who have a Cursed Phalanx.
* The KC requirement for both 'Tomb Raider' tasks has been reduced to 50.
* 'Novice Tomb Raider' has been moved to the Hard Tier of Combat Achievements.
* 'Tomb Raider' has been moved to the Master Tier of Combat Achievements.
* A number of items have been added to the restricted list for 'But... Damage'.
* Fail conditions for 'No Skipping Allowed' are now clearer.
* You'll no longer fail 'I'm In A Rush' after breaking a single boulder or fail 'All Praise Zebak' when losing Prayer Points in any other room.
* All versions of the Avernic Defender/Ghommal's Hilt combo now have the same placeholder.

'''Other Game Changes'''
* Fixed an issue causing the chatbox on Mobile to become unusable.
* We've made it clearer when tablets have been translated in The Garden of Death.
* The spooky cauldron behind Zaff's shop has been moved slightly.
* The signposts that open a full-screen display will no longer open on PvP or Deadman worlds.
* The Imbued Capes of the Gods from Mage Arena II now protect over more items on death.
* You'll now see the missing animations when Mining a Large Ash Pile.

'''In Case You Missed It'''
* The Winter Summit is almost here! Join us at 20:00 GMT, December 10th over on Twitch for massive reveals and more!

'''What's Coming Next Week'''
* This year's Christmas Event!
* Last Game Update of the year.
{{Collapsed section end}}
